  "solution": "Given:\n\n(5x - 2y) ∶ (x - 2y) = 9 ∶ 17\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nThe given ratio can be written as:\n\n(5x - 2y)/(x - 2y) = 9/17\n\n17 × (5x - 2y) = 9 × (x - 2y)\n\n85x - 34y = 9x - 18y\n\n76x = 16y\n\nx/y = 16/76\n\nx/y = 4/19\n\n9 × (4/19)/13 = 36/247\n\n**So, 9x/13y = 36/247.**",
